{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"72e7c455d95004f8","name":"card_unit_e13a_jake","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Japan/CovertOp/units/card_unit_e13a_jake","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"E13A JAKE","text":"When you lose a kredit slot, your units get +1+1.","flavorText":"The Aichi E13A, codenamed \"Jake\" by the Allies, was a long range reconnaissance seaplane used by the Imperial Japanese Navy from 1941 to 1945. The Aichi E13A was operational throughout the war and took on a variety of roles including coastal patrols, attacks on enemy convoys, communication duties, transporting officers, rescuing downed pilots, and even serving as kamikaze aircraft in the final stages of the war. In China it operated from seaplane tenders and cruisers, but it was also deployed on the battleships Yamato and Musashi for reconnaissance purposes, launched from their onboard catapults.The E13A was used as a scout for the Attack on Pearl Harbor, and during the Battles of the Coral Sea and Midway. A total of 1,418 aircraft were built, including a few variants.","faction":"Japan","type":"bomber","rarity":"Unique","cost":3,"operationCost":2,"attack":2,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_e13a_jake","title":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_e13a_jake_title","SourceString":"E13A JAKE","LocalizedString":"E13A JAKE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::bomber","attack":2,"defense":3,"range":2,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Japan","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_e13a_jake_text","SourceString":"When you lose a kredit slot, your units get +1+1.","LocalizedString":"When you lose a kredit slot, your units get +1+1."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_e13a_jake_history","SourceString":"The Aichi E13A, codenamed \"Jake\" by the Allies, was a long range reconnaissance seaplane used by the Imperial Japanese Navy from 1941 to 1945. The Aichi E13A was operational throughout the war and took on a variety of roles including coastal patrols, attacks on enemy convoys, communication duties, transporting officers, rescuing downed pilots, and even serving as kamikaze aircraft in the final stages of the war. In China it operated from seaplane tenders and cruisers, but it was also deployed on the battleships Yamato and Musashi for reconnaissance purposes, launched from their onboard catapults.The E13A was used as a scout for the Attack on Pearl Harbor, and during the Battles of the Coral Sea and Midway. A total of 1,418 aircraft were built, including a few variants.","LocalizedString":"The Aichi E13A, codenamed \"Jake\" by the Allies, was a long range reconnaissance seaplane used by the Imperial Japanese Navy from 1941 to 1945. The Aichi E13A was operational throughout the war and took on a variety of roles including coastal patrols, attacks on enemy convoys, communication duties, transporting officers, rescuing downed pilots, and even serving as kamikaze aircraft in the final stages of the war. In China it operated from seaplane tenders and cruisers, but it was also deployed on the battleships Yamato and Musashi for reconnaissance purposes, launched from their onboard catapults.The E13A was used as a scout for the Attack on Pearl Harbor, and during the Battles of the Coral Sea and Midway. A total of 1,418 aircraft were built, including a few variants."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_depl_biplane_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Biplane/AU_depl_biplane_Cue.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_move_biplane_01_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Biplane/AU_move_biplane_01_Cue.0"},"soundAttack":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'AU_move_biplane_01_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Biplane/AU_move_biplane_01_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Japan/CandidateArtwork/Su